":"s-shiji-003-yin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p021","quote":"帝小乙崩，子帝武丁立。帝武丁即位，思復興殷，而未得其佐。三年不言，政事決定於冢宰，以觀國風。武丁夜夢得聖人，名曰說。以夢所見視群臣百吏，皆非也。於是迺使百工營求之野，得說於傅險中。是時說為胥靡，筑於傅險。見於武丁，武丁曰是也。得而與之語，果聖人，舉以為相，殷國大治。故遂以傅險姓之，號曰傅說。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji003-029:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p021","start":126,"end":127,"surface":"相","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m021-0143","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p021","quote":"帝小乙崩，子帝武丁立。帝武丁即位，思復興殷，而未得其佐。三年不言，政事決定於冢宰，以觀國風。武丁夜夢得聖人，名曰說。以夢所見視群臣百吏，皆非也。於是迺使百工營求之野，得說於傅險中。是時說為胥靡，筑於傅險。見於武丁，武丁曰是也。得而與之語，果聖人，舉以為相，殷國大治。故遂以傅險姓之，號曰傅說。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"明言立或任相保存事件，父子、兄弟另由親屬主張解析，不以先王崩推出同年授任。中宗與高后保留用稱，未知年代、終點與授予方式不補造。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[{"id":"shiji-013-t2-r021-c00-m001","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"傅說","person_id":"p77_x5q_v4n","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依〈三代世表〉殷王世系與《殷本紀》暫定同指；湯子太丁與武乙子太丁分別辨認。","table_id":"shiji-013","table_fragment_id":"shiji-013-digital-table-2","table_row_id":"shiji-013-t2-r021","table_cell_id":"shiji-013-t2-r021-c00","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-013","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-013","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-013","source_revision":"2606991","kind":"table_person_mention","quote":"帝武丁。雉升鼎耳雊。得傅說。稱高宗。"}],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji003-016","person_id":"p77_x5q_v4n","surfaces":["說","傅說"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-003-yin"],"status":"source_explicit","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p021","quote":"故遂以傅險姓之，號曰傅說"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p021","quote":"名曰說"}],"rationale":"結合本段名曰說、得說與傅險姓之的敘事，同指個人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji130-first50-stage2-cross-22","person_id":"p77_x5q_v4n","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-130-taishigong","c-shiji-003-yin"],"status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"high","surfaces":["說"],"identification_basis":{"kind":"source_context","target_mention_ids":["c-shiji-130-taishigong:m015-0023"]},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-130","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong","chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:p015","quote":"維契作商，爰及成湯；太甲居桐，德盛阿衡；武丁得說，乃稱高宗；帝辛湛湎，諸侯不享。作殷本紀第三。"},{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-003","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin","chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p021","quote":"帝小乙崩，子帝武丁立。帝武丁即位，思復興殷，而未得其佐。三年不言，政事決定於冢宰，以觀國風。武丁夜夢得聖人，名曰說。以夢所見視群臣百吏，皆非也。於是迺使百工營求之野，得說於傅險中。是時說為胥靡，筑於傅險。見於武丁，武丁曰是也。得而與之語，果聖人，舉以為相，殷國大治。故遂以傅險姓之，號曰傅說。"}],"prior_source_qualifications":[{"source_mention_ids":["c-shiji-130-taishigong:m015-0023"],"metadata":{"label":"說（武丁得說）（太史公自序候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"original_registry_record_sha256":"5c185d0527966fa0bda0fb10f2988eb0a425ae24397b8fed1482a1616023a3ba","qualification":"合併前來源限定判讀；逐值保留，不替代現役人物既有姓名、historicty或review。"}],"rationale":"武丁傅險得說舉相，明號傅說；不接韓說中行說。 原詞、篇題、引語/補作層及來源傳統資格不改；不新增生平、遠祖連接或日期。","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p010","text":"夫傅說之相高宗，申召之輔宣王，管仲之佐齊桓，衰范之翼晉文，或宗師其道，垂拱受成，委以權重，終至匡主，未有憂其逼己，還為國蠹者也。始田氏擅齊，王莽篡漢，皆藉封土之強，假累世之寵，因暗弱之主，資母后之權，樹比周之黨，階絕滅之勢，然後乃能行其私謀，以成篡奪之禍耳。豈遇立功之主，為天人所相，而能運其奸計，以濟其不軌者哉！光武以王族奮于閭閻，因時之望，收攬英奇，遂續漢業，以美中興之功。及天下既定，頗廢黜功臣者，何哉？武力之士不達國體，以立一時之功，不可久假以權勢，其興廢之事，亦可見矣。近者三國鼎峙，並以雄略之才，命世之能，皆委賴俊哲，終成功業，貽之後嗣，未有愆失遺方來之恨者也。","source_position":{"raw_start":1911,"raw_end":2200,"raw_text":"　　夫傅說之相高宗，申召之輔宣王，管仲之佐齊桓，衰范之翼晉文，或宗師其道，垂拱受成，委以權重，終至匡主，未有憂其逼己，還為國蠹者也。始田氏擅齊，王莽篡漢，皆藉封土之強，假累世之寵，因暗弱之主，資母后之權，樹比周之黨，階絕滅之勢，然後乃能行其私謀，以成篡奪之禍耳。豈遇立功之主，為天人所相，而能運其奸計，以濟其不軌者哉！光武以王族奮于閭閻，因時之望，收攬英奇，遂續漢業，以美中興之功。及天下既定，頗廢黜功臣者，何哉？武力之士不達國體，以立一時之功，不可久假以權勢，其興廢之事，亦可見矣。近者三國鼎峙，並以雄略之才，命世之能，皆委賴俊哲，終成功業，貽之後嗣，未有愆失遺方來之恨者也。","display_wrapper_start":0,"display_wrapper_end":0,"raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-7903772-raw.wikitext"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p010:m0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"傅說","kind":"person","person_id":"p77_x5q_v4n","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p010:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"高宗","kind":"person","person_id":"cld_aan_e20","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p010:m0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"申","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。","candidate_person_ids":[]},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p010:m0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"召","kind":"person","person_id":"s74_0jk_msn","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p010:m0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"lt5_gcv_iqh","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p010:m0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"管仲","kind":"person","person_id":"h1v_8ap_b9y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p010:m0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"齊桓","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p010:m0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"衰","kind":"person","person_id":"dm0_58v_50i","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p010:m0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"范","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"原作衰范；范之具體身份未由本段明言，不憑慣用說補名。","candidate_person_ids":["wt0_abc_2sk"]},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p010:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"晉文","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p010:m0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"王莽","kind":"person","person_id":"r0x_57x_bd5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p010:m0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"光武","kind":"person","person_id":"6c9_c43_555","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。"}],"annotation_status":"reviewed","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family","book_id":"b-jinshu-061","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-061-ws7903772"},{"id":"c-jinshu-071-chenyun:p002","text":"劾案沛王韜獄，未竟，會解結代楊准為刺史，韜因河間王顒屬結。結至大會，問主簿史鳳曰：「沛王貴籓，州據何法而擅拘邪？」時頵在坐，對曰：「甲午詔書，刺史銜命，國之外台，其非所部而在境者，刺史並糾。事征文墨，前後列上，七被詔書。如州所劾，無有違謬。」結曰：「眾人之言不可妄聽，宜依法窮竟。」又問僚佐曰：「河北白壤膏粱，何故少人士，每以三品為中正？」答曰：「《詩》稱'維嶽降神，生甫及申'。夫英偉大賢多出於山澤，河北土平氣均，蓬蒿裁高三尺，不足成林故也。」結曰：「張彥真以為汝潁巧辯，恐不及青徐儒雅也。」頵曰：「彥真與元禮不協，故設過言。老子、莊周生陳梁，伏羲、傅說、師曠、大項出陽夏，漢魏二祖起於沛譙，准之眾州，莫之與比。」結甚異之，曰：「豫州人士常半天下，此言非虛。」會結遷尚書，結恨不得盡其才用。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":75,"last_line":75,"raw_start":5742,"raw_end":6088,"raw_character_offsets":[5742,5743,5744,5745,5746,5747,5748,5749,5750,5751,5752,5753,5754,5755,5756,5757,5758,5759,5760,5761,5762,5763,5764,5765,5766,5767,5768,5769,5770,5771,5772,5773,5774,5775,5776,5777,5778,5779,5780,5781,5782,5783,5784,5785,5786,5787,5788,5789,5790,5791,5792,5793,5794,5795,5796,5797,5798,5799,5800,5801,5802,5803,5804,5805,5806,5807,5808,5809,5810,5811,5812,5813,5814,5815,5816,5817,5818,5819,5820,5821,5822,5823,5824,5825,5826,5827,5828,5829,5830,5831,5832,5833,5834,5835,5836,5837,5838,5839,5840,5841,5842,5843,5844,5845,5846,5847,5848,5849,5850,5851,5852,5853,5854,5855,5856,5857,5858,5859,5860,5861,5862,5863,5864,5865,5866,5867,5868,5869,5870,5871,5872,5873,5874,587